* [[Media:Decipher_Glossary_1998.pdf|Decipher Glossary (November 1998)]], PDF page 59, matching documentary wording.
* Set and rarity: underlying [[Flagship]]. The gallery face carries the Dagobah set icon.
|errata_history=The gallery image prints a bronze round disc without an E or number. Its words match the November 1998 Glossary entry, including “system or sector,” “If starship lost” and “Immune to your Alter.” The June 2017 partial and the full face in the 2018 import repeat those words but use a literal <code>E</code> mark and a different rendering. Physical printing and later images: [[File:Flagship-PC-gallery-2007-through-2026-comparison.png|thumb|center|300px|Physical scan and six PC image versions.]]
|notes=* The capture establishes availability by 16 December 2007, not a first publication day.<ref name="gallery">[https://web.archive.org/web/20071216201429id_/http://www.swccgpc.com/cards/dagobah/ds/flagship.gif PC gallery capture], 16 December 2007, 20:14:29 UTC.</ref>
* Destiny 3, the unique dot, lore and game text are printed on the gallery face. Rarity is underlying catalogue information. The 2023 rulebook also prints this historical wording ([[Media:SWCCG_2023_AdvancedRulebook.pdf|Advanced Rulebook (2023)]], PDF page 112); the later July 2026 face changes the loss phrase to “about to be lost.”
